<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/caption> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "If both description and caption are present in the metadata, a description is typically displayed instead of the resource, a caption together with the resource. Thus, in HTML it would be appropriate to use ac:caption values in figcaption elements. Often only one of description or caption is present; choose the term most appropriate for your metadata."@en .
