<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/commentDate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Date and Time of Comment"@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/commentDate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The date and time MUST comply with the World Wide Web Consortium (W3C) datetime practice, https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-datetime, which requires that date and time representation correspond to ISO 8601:1998, but with year fields always comprising 4 digits. This makes datetime records compliant with 8601:2004, https://www.iso.org/standard/40874.html. AC datetime values MAY also follow 8601:2004 for ranges by separating two ISO 8601 datetime fields by a solidus (\"forward slash\", '/')."@en .
