<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/frameRate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "For example, in a recording where 60 consecutive images (frames) are captured for each second of the real-time recording, this would be 60. In a time-lapse recording where one image (frame) is recorded every 5 seconds of recording, this would be 0.2."@en .
