<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/frameRate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Frame Rate"@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/frameRate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The decimal fraction representing the frequency (rate) at which consecutive images (frames) were captured in real time for a moving image, expressed as the number of frames per second."@en .
