<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/mediaSpeed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Media Speed"@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/mediaSpeed> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "If a value for ac:mediaSpeed is not provided, applications SHOULD assume that 1.0 is the value."@en .
