<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/metadataLanguageLiteral> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Language of description and other metadata (but not necessarily of the image itself) represented as an ISO639-2 three letter language code."@en .
