<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/otherScientificName> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2013-10-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/otherScientificName> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The primary purpose of this is in support of resource discovery, not developing a taxonomic synonymy. Misidentification or misspellings may thus be of interest. Where multiple taxa are present in a resource and multiple Scientific Taxon Names are given, the association between synonyms and names may not be deducible from the AC record alone."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/otherScientificName> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion> <http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/version/otherScientificName-2013-10-28> .
