<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/otherScientificName> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/attributes/repeatable> "Yes" .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/otherScientificName> <http://rs.tdwg.org/dwc/terms/attributes/required> "No" .
