<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/physicalSetting> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2013-10-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/physicalSetting> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Multiple values may be needed for movies or montages. See also ac:resourceCreationTechnique which should be used to describe any modifications to the resource itself. Communities of practice should form best practices for the use of these controlled terms."@en .
