<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/provider> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "If no separate Metadata Provider is given, this also attributes the metadata."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/providerID.rdf> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Biodiversity Information Standards (TDWG)" .
