<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/reviewer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "If present, then resource is peer-reviewed, even if Reviewer Comments is absent or empty. Its presence tells whether an expert in the subject featured in the media has reviewed the media item or collection and approved its metadata description; MUST display a name or the literal \"anonymous\" (= anonymously reviewed)."@en .
<http://rs.tdwg.org/ac/terms/reviewerComments.rdf> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> "Biodiversity Information Standards (TDWG)" .
